{
  "id": "memorizon_world_models",
  "title": "Memorizon: Training World Models Beyond Their Context Window",
  "category": "mechanism_deepdive",
  "domain_taxonomy": "neural_attention",
  "hook_tag": "MEMORY ARCHITECTURE",
  "beats": [
    {
      "beat_id": 1,
      "text": "How can an AI recall a spot it saw just now without using up all its energy on each tiny, small, fast image?",
      "visual_focus": "A camera moving through a long corridor with flickering memory fragments.",
      "highlight_words": {
        "brain power": "#EF4444"
      },
      "svo_action": {
        "subject": "World Model",
        "action_verb": "drains",
        "direct_object": "Context Window Capacity",
        "anchor_word": "power",
        "semantic_role": "causal_elimination"
      },
      "visual_blueprint": {
        "layout": "pipeline_stages",
        "title": "THE MEMORY PARADOX",
        "sub": "Comparing long-span vision vs compute constraints",
        "accent_color": "#EF4444",
        "params": {
          "stage_1_label": "Long History",
          "stage_1_sub": "Minutes of video",
          "stage_2_label": "Quadratic Cost",
          "stage_2_sub": "Attention explosion",
          "stage_3_label": "Model Crash",
          "stage_3_sub": "System overload"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": 2,
      "text": "Think of a library where you do not read each book, you just pick key notes from a shared desk for your big task.",
      "visual_focus": "A bustling library with cards floating from shelves into a central index desk.",
      "highlight_words": {
        "library": "#38BDF8"
      },
      "svo_action": {
        "subject": "Retrieval Engine",
        "action_verb": "fetches",
        "direct_object": "Key Frame Latents",
        "anchor_word": "cards",
        "semantic_role": "agent_action"
      },
      "visual_blueprint": {
        "layout": "catalog_routing",
        "title": "INDEXED RETRIEVAL",
        "sub": "Accessing memory without reading full sequence",
        "accent_color": "#38BDF8",
        "params": {
          "index_label": "Active Memory Bank",
          "drawer_a_label": "Recent",
          "drawer_b_label": "Shared",
          "drawer_c_label": "Previous"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": 3,
      "text": "We teach the bot to hold just the last few parts, making a small stack of key shots from each path it takes.",
      "visual_focus": "A stream of video frames being condensed into tiny, glowing data squares.",
      "highlight_words": {
        "snapshots": "#34D399"
      },
      "svo_action": {
        "subject": "Training Loop",
        "action_verb": "compresses",
        "direct_object": "Temporal History",
        "anchor_word": "snapshots",
        "semantic_role": "state_transition"
      },
      "visual_blueprint": {
        "layout": "convergence_funnel",
        "title": "SNAPSHOT CONDENSATION",
        "sub": "Merging long timelines into sparse storage",
        "accent_color": "#34D399",
        "params": {
          "input_1_label": "Chunk A",
          "input_2_label": "Chunk B",
          "input_3_label": "Chunk C",
          "fused_label": "Shared Bank"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": 4,
      "text": "The bot uses views to link these parts, like a sculptor who wipes off the clay to keep only the main, strong form.",
      "visual_focus": "Light rays connecting two distant points in a 3D scene, discarding surrounding haze.",
      "highlight_words": {
        "sight-lines": "#F59E0B"
      },
      "svo_action": {
        "subject": "Attention Gate",
        "action_verb": "projects",
        "direct_object": "Co-Visible Latents",
        "anchor_word": "sight-lines",
        "semantic_role": "agent_action"
      },
      "visual_blueprint": {
        "layout": "projection_rays",
        "title": "GEOMETRIC ALIGNMENT",
        "sub": "Linking revisits through camera perspective",
        "accent_color": "#F59E0B",
        "params": {
          "camera_label": "Revisit Camera",
          "focal_plane_label": "Common Viewpoint",
          "target_label": "Shared Latent"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": 5,
      "text": "Now, the bot stays sharp for a long time. It keeps things clear while the cost stays low for any length of trip.",
      "visual_focus": "A cost graph showing a sharp spike for old methods and a flat line for the new model.",
      "highlight_words": {
        "consistency": "#34D399"
      },
      "svo_action": {
        "subject": "System Latency",
        "action_verb": "stabilizes",
        "direct_object": "Compute Load",
        "anchor_word": "flat",
        "semantic_role": "metric_evaluation"
      },
      "visual_blueprint": {
        "layout": "comparison_side_by_side",
        "title": "COST VS PERFORMANCE",
        "sub": "Memorizon vs Standard Sliding Window",
        "accent_color": "#34D399",
        "params": {
          "col_a_title": "Sliding Window",
          "col_a_stat": "High Cost",
          "col_b_title": "Memorizon",
          "col_b_stat": "Flat Cost"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": 6,
      "text": "Follow The Model Verse for easy chats on how our new tech works in a way that makes sense for you each day.",
      "visual_focus": "Logo overlay of The Model Verse with a clean, fading background.",
      "highlight_words": {
        "The Model Verse": "#34D399"
      },
      "svo_action": {
        "subject": "The Model Verse",
        "action_verb": "explains",
        "direct_object": "AI Mechanisms",
        "anchor_word": "explanations",
        "semantic_role": "agent_action"
      },
      "visual_blueprint": {
        "layout": "layer_stack",
        "title": "THE MODEL VERSE",
        "sub": "Simplified frontier AI",
        "accent_color": "#FFFFFF",
        "params": {
          "bottom_layer": "Architecture",
          "mid_layer": "Training",
          "top_layer": "Insight"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
